//
// The decode (aie2_decode.py) at 2 layers on NPU2: up to 4 tokens per
// dispatch, on-chip lm_head, sampler and feedback, growing KV. Every token,
// its record's seed, the last token's final residual and the whole KV cache
// match the numpy oracle, from an empty cache, across dispatches with the NPU
// idle between them, into the cache's last rows, for a split dispatch,
// sampled, and for a prompt in batches. --synthetic-weights swaps the
// embedding table and the layers' own weights for seeded ones in the same
// layout. 16 real layers are the nightly component check.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, xrt_python_bindings, xrt_python_ctrl_scratchpad_bo
//
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% %python %S/test_chain_persist_grow_mh.py --synthetic-weights --start-pos 0 | FileCheck --check-prefix=EMPTY %s
// EMPTY: KV cache: PASS
// EMPTY: chain_persist_grow_mh: 4/4 tokens PASS
//
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% %python %S/test_chain_persist_grow_mh.py --synthetic-weights --start-pos 62 --dispatches 2 --idle-s 6 | FileCheck --check-prefix=CARRY %s
// CARRY: KV cache: PASS
// CARRY: chain_persist_grow_mh: 8/8 tokens PASS
// CARRY: carry across 2 dispatches: PASS
//
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% %python %S/test_chain_persist_grow_mh.py --synthetic-weights --start-pos 124 | FileCheck --check-prefix=END %s
// END: KV cache: PASS
// END: chain_persist_grow_mh: 4/4 tokens PASS
//
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% %python %S/test_chain_persist_grow_mh.py --synthetic-weights --start-pos 62 --passes 3 --split | FileCheck --check-prefix=SPLIT %s
// SPLIT: KV cache: PASS
// SPLIT: chain_persist_grow_mh: 3/3 tokens PASS
// SPLIT: 3 tokens vs 3 x 1: PASS
//
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% %python %S/test_chain_persist_grow_mh.py --synthetic-weights --start-pos 5 --sample-temp 0.7 --sample-topk 4 --sample-seed 1234 --dispatches 2 | FileCheck --check-prefix=SAMPLED %s
// SAMPLED: sampler state: PASS
// SAMPLED: sampler state: PASS
// SAMPLED: chain_persist_grow_mh: 8/8 tokens PASS
// SAMPLED: carry across 2 dispatches: PASS
// SAMPLED: sampled draws: 8/8 distinct states PASS
//
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% %python %S/test_chain_persist_grow_mh.py --synthetic-weights --start-pos 60 --prompt-tokens 7 --vs-batch 1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=PROMPT %s
// PROMPT: KV cache: PASS
// PROMPT: chain_persist_grow_mh: 5/5 tokens PASS
// PROMPT: carry across 3 dispatches: PASS
// PROMPT: prompt in batches of 4 vs 1: PASS
